  <h1>Design</h1>
  <p class="design-lede">Components in every state they can be in, built from fixtures rather than
    from the database. If a screen needs a state that is not here, it gets added here first — and if
    a state cannot be reached by setting properties, the component has stopped being a presenter.</p>
